@startuml
title MEDORA: Clinical Note Version Lifecycle
!include ../../../../shared/templates/medora-style.puml
skinparam dpi 192
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 18
state "Amendment Draft" as AmendmentDraft
state "Amended Signed Version" as AmendedSigned
[*] --> Draft : create()
Draft --> Draft : save() [content valid for draft]
Draft --> Signed : sign() [required fields valid and actor authorized] / preserve signed version
Signed --> AmendmentDraft : requestAmendment(reason) [authorized]
AmendmentDraft --> AmendmentDraft : saveAmendment()
AmendmentDraft --> AmendedSigned : signAmendment() [required fields valid] / preserve prior signed version
AmendmentDraft --> Signed : abandonAmendment()
AmendedSigned --> AmendmentDraft : requestAmendment(reason) [authorized]
note right of Signed
  A signed version is immutable. An amendment creates a linked
  successor version and never overwrites the signed source.
end note
@enduml
